You take the rucksack off your back, and slowly sink on the ground, right on the soft underlayer of herbs. You can hardly keep your eyes open,  mind clouds. Strange, because you just had a fine rest... The night was rough, but it still counts...
You close your eyes and fall into a deep slumber, that has no way out. Fragrance of flowers is like narcosis, that takes effect unless you stop to inhale it. Your adventure ends here.